A: How do you say I see my brother in Russian?
    draw masha masha_name station

A: In lesson fourteen we saw ма́му and кни́гу, but left брат and кот for later.
    draw later

    erase later

A: Later is now. Tom phones Masha: listen first, with no words on the screen.
    draw tom tom_name

A: Ма́ша, ты где?
    draw phone caption false

B: Я на вокза́ле. Я жду бра́та.
    draw phone_m caption false

    ask "Who is Masha waiting for at the station?" listen "Я жду бра́та." voice b options ["her mum","her dad","her brother"] correct 3
        gloss: I'm waiting for my brother.
        right: Her brother: бра́та.
        wrong: Listen for брат in it.
    voice a

    erase station

    hide tom tom_name phone phone_m masha masha_name

A: Жду is new: I'm waiting for. Ждать goes жду, ждёшь, ждёт.
    draw masha masha_name s1 verb

A: And listen to the brother: not брат, but бра́та, with an а on the end.
    highlight s1_w_3 color #1a8a8a part а$

A: You've met that а before, in lesson twenty-eight: нет кота́. It's the of-ending.
    draw ref28

A: So here is the rule: a living he that ends in a consonant, like брат or кот, takes the of-ending when he is the object.
    highlight ref28 color #1a8a8a part а$

    erase s1 verb ref28

    hide masha masha_name

B: Я ви́жу дом. Я ви́жу кота́.
    draw h_th h_al t1 a1 t2 a2

A: A house stays дом, as in lesson fourteen, and so does по́езд; but брат and кот are alive, so бра́та, кота́.
    highlight a1 a2 color #1a8a8a part а$

A: The question word does it too: кто becomes кого́, but что stays что.
    draw t3 a3

A: Say it ka-vó: the г sounds like в, as in сего́дня. Кого́ ты ждёшь? Who are you waiting for?
    highlight a3 color #8f887c part кого effect underline

    erase board

B: Друг, a friend: я жду дру́га. Сосе́д, a neighbour: я ви́жу сосе́да.
    draw p_friend l_friend p_neigh l_neigh

B: Учи́тель, a teacher, ends in ь, and the ь becomes я: я зна́ю учи́теля.
    draw p_teach l_teach

A: But па́па and де́душка, grandad, are а-words, like ма́ма: я жду па́пу, я ви́жу де́душку.
    draw p_papa l_papa p_ded l_ded

    erase p_friend l_friend p_neigh l_neigh p_teach l_teach p_papa l_papa p_ded l_ded

A: Now Tom is at the station too. Listen, and then you can practise it.
    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Приве́т, Ма́ша! Кого́ ты ждёшь?","gloss":"Hi, Masha! Who are you waiting for?"},{"by":"b","text":"Бра́та. Ива́н е́дет на по́езде.","gloss":"My brother. Ivan is coming by train."},{"by":"a","text":"А, Ива́на! Я зна́ю Ива́на.","gloss":"Ah, Ivan! I know Ivan."},{"by":"b","text":"Смотри́! Ты ви́дишь по́езд?","gloss":"Look! Do you see the train?"},{"by":"a","text":"Ви́жу по́езд. И ви́жу кота́!","gloss":"I see the train. And I see a cat!"},{"by":"b","text":"Э́то кот Ива́на! Ива́н, приве́т!","gloss":"It's Ivan's cat! Ivan, hi!"}] practice true size 1.6

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

A: Ви́жу по́езд, but ви́жу кота́: the train is a thing, and the cat is alive.
    text pk "ви́жу по́езд  ·  ви́жу кота́" say "ви́жу по́езд, ви́жу кота́" colors {"а$":"#1a8a8a"} x 500 y 470 font_size 52

    erase pk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    icon q_friend size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["man","person"] icon_look picture of "man raising hand"

    quiz "Tom sees his friend. Я ви́жу ___. Which word fills the gap?" reveal.text "Я ви́жу дру́га." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Дру́га: a friend is alive, so he takes the of-ending а.
        wrong: A friend is alive, so after ви́жу he takes the of-ending: друг adds а.
        * друг
        + дру́га
        * дру́гу

    erase q_friend

    icon q_house size 160 set twemoji x 380 y 470 or ["house with garden"] icon_look picture of house
    icon q_cat size 160 set twemoji x 620 y 470 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat

    quiz "Masha sees a house and a cat. Which is right?" reveal.text "Я ви́жу дом и кота́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: The house is a thing and stays дом; the cat is alive: кота́.
        wrong: Which of the two is alive?
        * Я ви́жу дом и кот.
        * Я ви́жу до́ма и кота́.
        + Я ви́жу дом и кота́.

    erase q_house q_cat

    icon q_dad size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["bearded person","person"] icon_look picture of "man: beard"

    quiz "Masha is waiting for her dad. Я жду ___. Which is right?" reveal.text "Я жду па́пу." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Па́пу: па́па ends in а, so it goes like ма́ма, ма́му.
        wrong: Па́па ends in а, like ма́ма. What did ма́ма become after ви́жу?
        + па́пу
        * па́па
        * па́пы

    erase q_dad

    icon q_station size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["railway car","train"] icon_look picture of station

    ask "You meet Masha at the station. Ask her who she is waiting for." say_it "Кого́ ты ждёшь?" gloss "Who are you waiting for?" voice a show cue test t1
    voice a

B: Бра́та! Я жду бра́та.
    icon q_masha size 150 set twemoji x 250 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    text q_say "Кого́ ты ждёшь? — Бра́та!" say "Кого́ ты ждёшь? Бра́та!" colors {"а$":"#1a8a8a"} x 500 y 300 font_size 56

    erase q_station q_say q_masha

    icon q_teach size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["teacher","man"] icon_look picture of "man teacher"

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: I'm waiting for the teacher." answer ["я жду учителя","жду учителя"] reveal.text "Я жду учи́теля." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Я жду учи́теля: the ь of учи́тель becomes я.
        wrong: Start with я жду, then учи́тель: what does a living he become?

    erase q_teach

    icon score_woman size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase score_woman

    show board

A: So listen for that а: a living he that ends in a consonant takes the of-ending, бра́та, кота́, Ива́на; па́па goes like ма́ма, па́пу; and a thing stays as it is.
    highlight a1 a2 color #1a8a8a part а$

    erase board

B: Я ви́жу Ива́на и кота́! Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 380 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon end_cat size 150 set twemoji x 620 y 470 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat
    text end_say "Я ви́жу Ива́на и кота́!" say "Я ви́жу Ива́на и кота́!" colors {"а$":"#1a8a8a"} x 500 y 290 font_size 60

    erase end_masha end_cat end_say

A: Next time: рабо́таю врачо́м, I work as a doctor.
